+STANK TANK — BUFF'S PRIVATE TRIAL
+
+Double-click Buff Controls.url. It opens the controls in your normal browser.
+No models, Python, Node or Tailscale are needed on your computer.
+The producer must have STANK TANK running on their computer.
+
+TRY IT
+1. Wait for the panel to connect. Leave Dyad ON for the auditioned Lite voices.
+2. Enter a short comment and click Test React or Test Read + React.
+3. Try ARGUE or MAKE IT RAIN when the show is idle.
+4. STOP immediately cancels the performance. It does not close the producer's app.
+The controls and dialogue history work over HTTPS. Real paid intake is disabled
+in this private trial. The donation buttons are synthetic tests.
+
+WATCHING AND SOUND
+Live Show Viewer.url opens the browser stage. There is only one sound owner.
+For a browser trial on YOUR computer, ask the producer to close their Live Show
+window, leave Live Show mode selected, then reopen your viewer. Click Enable
+sound once if your browser requests it. Keep that viewer open during the trial;
+it can remain in the background.
+Do not open several viewers. STOP if the stage or audio disconnects.
+
+For an OBS trial on your computer, add a Browser Source using the entire address
+in OBS Browser Source.txt, set 1920 x 1080, enable Control audio via OBS, and select
+OBS Reactive in the controls. The producer's OBS does not need to be open.
+Your own network's video/audio connection is the first remote acceptance check;
+HTTPS controls have been verified, but that cannot certify your WebRTC path.
+
+THIS IS A TEMPORARY LINK
+The address stops working when the producer stops sharing or restarts the tunnel.
+If it stops connecting, ask for a fresh trial folder. Do not edit the address.
+These launchers contain private access keys. Send them only to Buff; do not post
+them in chat, a stream overlay, or a public repository.
